- New README section '🔥 GitHub Daily Streak' with its own heading,
  separate from the external GitHub Analytics badges.
- generate_github_stats.py now also computes today's contribution
  count and a 14-day recent-activity window (today_contribution_count,
  recent_activity), sourced from the same GraphQL contribution
  calendar already being fetched -- no extra API calls.
- Streak card redesigned: 4 stats (current streak / longest streak /
  today / total) plus a 14-day activity bar strip with today
  highlighted.
- Fixed a footer/legend text overlap in the contribution heatmap card.
- Added .gitignore for Python test artifacts.

No changes to hero, About Me, Tech Stack, Connect, or footer sections.
